WEBVTT

00:00:09.204 --> 00:00:10.724
You look ghastly, Robert.

00:00:10.884 --> 00:00:12.684
I haven't been sleeping.

00:00:13.444 --> 00:00:16.764
I broke my daughter,
they keep changing math...

00:00:16.924 --> 00:00:19.884
we needed double-A batteries,
but I got triple-A's...

00:00:20.044 --> 00:00:22.764
and now we still need
double-A batteries.

00:00:22.924 --> 00:00:25.124
I put one red thing
in a load of whites

00:00:25.204 --> 00:00:27.164
and now everything's pink.

00:00:27.324 --> 00:00:28.524
And I think we need eggs.

00:00:28.684 --> 00:00:32.244
Done properly,
parenting is a heroic act.

00:00:32.404 --> 00:00:34.004
Done properly.

00:00:34.164 --> 00:00:37.044
I am fortunate that it has
never afflicted me.

00:00:37.204 --> 00:00:38.924
But you do not come to me

00:00:39.004 --> 00:00:41.244
for eggs and batteries,
Robert.

00:00:41.404 --> 00:00:42.964
I design herowear

00:00:43.044 --> 00:00:45.404
and Elastigirl
must have a new suit.

00:00:45.524 --> 00:00:47.644
(SIGHS) Actually,
it's Jack-Jack.

00:00:48.204 --> 00:00:51.004
You also wish
a new suit for the baby?

00:00:51.164 --> 00:00:54.364
I would hardly classify
this as an emergency.

00:00:55.284 --> 00:00:57.724
Well, he's a special case.
Worth studying.

00:00:57.884 --> 00:00:59.644
If I could just leave him
with you for a while...

00:00:59.804 --> 00:01:01.564
Leave him? Here?

00:01:02.924 --> 00:01:05.004
I am not a baby person,
Robert.

00:01:05.164 --> 00:01:07.964
I have no baby facilities.
I am an artist.

00:01:08.124 --> 00:01:10.964
I do not involve myself in
the prosaic day-to-day to...

00:01:11.924 --> 00:01:13.124
day.

00:01:14.884 --> 00:01:16.044
(CHUCKLES)

00:01:16.564 --> 00:01:18.284
Fascinating!

00:01:20.964 --> 00:01:22.804
Are you seeing this, Robert?

00:01:24.604 --> 00:01:25.804
Dada.

00:01:27.124 --> 00:01:28.204
(SNEEZES)

00:01:28.284 --> 00:01:29.724
(SCREAMING)

00:01:34.924 --> 00:01:37.564
-(GIGGLING)
-Oh, my God.

00:01:38.484 --> 00:01:39.524
Yes!

00:01:40.244 --> 00:01:41.804
Of course you can leave
the baby overnight.

00:01:41.964 --> 00:01:43.484
I'm sure filling in for Helen
is challenging,

00:01:43.564 --> 00:01:44.564
and you are very tired...

00:01:44.724 --> 00:01:45.844
and the other children
need you

00:01:45.924 --> 00:01:47.004
and miss you,
and you must go to them.

00:01:47.164 --> 00:01:48.724
Auntie Edna will take care
of everything...

00:01:48.924 --> 00:01:51.684
so, drive safely and goodbye.
I enjoy our visits.

00:01:54.404 --> 00:01:56.364
"Auntie Edna"?

00:01:56.444 --> 00:01:58.444
-(UPBEAT MUSIC PLAYING)
-(INDISTINCT CHATTER)

00:02:00.724 --> 00:02:01.644
(GLASS CLINKING)

00:02:01.764 --> 00:02:03.084
WINSTON: Attention. Attention.

00:02:03.164 --> 00:02:05.444
I wanna thank everyone
that came out tonight...

00:02:05.644 --> 00:02:07.124
in support of superheroes...

00:02:07.284 --> 00:02:10.484
and bringing them
back into society!

00:02:10.644 --> 00:02:12.164
-(ALL APPLAUDING)
-You all made it happen.

00:02:12.364 --> 00:02:13.644
The need for this
has been made

00:02:13.724 --> 00:02:15.084
crystal clear
in recent days...

00:02:15.244 --> 00:02:17.084
with bad actors
like the self-proclaimed

00:02:17.164 --> 00:02:19.004
Screenslaver
threatening our peace.

00:02:19.164 --> 00:02:20.524
His reign was short, huh?

00:02:20.604 --> 00:02:22.804
-(ALL CHEER)
-And thanks to this woman...

00:02:22.964 --> 00:02:26.044
a great super.
You love her. You missed her.

00:02:26.244 --> 00:02:29.164
-Welcome back, Elastigirl.
-(ALL CHEERING)

00:02:30.084 --> 00:02:32.604
Come on up here.
Don't be bashful.

00:02:32.764 --> 00:02:34.364
-Come on. Get up here.
-(GLASSES CLINKING)

00:02:35.164 --> 00:02:37.644
I want you to have this.

00:02:37.844 --> 00:02:39.564
A memento.

00:02:39.724 --> 00:02:42.924
Thanks, Winston, Evelyn,
and everyone at DEVTECH.

00:02:43.084 --> 00:02:44.884
I am forever in your debt.

00:02:45.044 --> 00:02:46.804
And thanks to all of you,

00:02:46.884 --> 00:02:49.644
your pressure
changed all the right minds.

00:02:50.044 --> 00:02:52.324
We've made amazing headway
in a very short time...

00:02:52.524 --> 00:02:55.564
which leads me
to an important announcement.

00:02:55.724 --> 00:02:57.844
Just now,
at a worldwide summit...

00:02:58.004 --> 00:02:59.764
leaders from more than
a hundred

00:02:59.844 --> 00:03:01.364
of the world's
top countries...

00:03:01.524 --> 00:03:04.964
have agreed to make
superheroes legal again!

00:03:05.084 --> 00:03:06.924
(ALL CHEERING)

00:03:07.004 --> 00:03:08.604
We'll gather superheroes
and leaders

00:03:08.684 --> 00:03:09.844
from all over the planet...

00:03:10.044 --> 00:03:11.564
on our boat, the Everjust...

00:03:11.724 --> 00:03:15.124
for a televised
signing ceremony at sea.

00:03:15.284 --> 00:03:18.844
Now if you'll excuse us,
we got a ship to catch!

00:03:18.924 --> 00:03:20.444
(ALL CHEERING)

00:03:22.404 --> 00:03:24.284
WINSTON: So good to see you.
Thanks for coming out.

00:03:24.444 --> 00:03:26.604
Hey.
Hi, it's me, again.

00:03:26.724 --> 00:03:29.484
Um, there's, uh, something
I've always wanted to ask you.

00:03:29.684 --> 00:03:32.244
Yeah, how do you balance
the superhero stuff

00:03:32.324 --> 00:03:33.404
with the life stuff?

00:03:34.244 --> 00:03:36.084
I know I can handle
the superhero stuff.

00:03:36.364 --> 00:03:37.764
(CONVERSATION FADES)

00:03:39.164 --> 00:03:40.484
Uh-huh, uh-huh. Oh.

00:03:40.564 --> 00:03:42.444
Would you please
excuse me a moment?

00:03:42.524 --> 00:03:45.324
Oh. Yeah, okay, see you later!
Good talk!

00:03:45.404 --> 00:03:46.684
(INDISTINCT CHATTER)

00:04:06.964 --> 00:04:09.204
-BOB: Hey, Vi.
-Hey.

00:04:10.284 --> 00:04:11.284
Where's Jack-Jack?

00:04:11.484 --> 00:04:12.884
BOB: E's taking him
for a little bit.

00:04:13.044 --> 00:04:15.524
-Edna is babysitting?
-Yeah.

00:04:15.684 --> 00:04:17.604
And you're okay with this?

00:04:17.764 --> 00:04:20.204
Yeah. I don't know why,
but yeah.

00:04:20.964 --> 00:04:22.044
(BOB SIGHS)

00:04:22.124 --> 00:04:24.604
I wanted to say
something to you.

00:04:25.884 --> 00:04:27.884
Sorry about Tony.

00:04:28.524 --> 00:04:31.324
I didn't think about Dicker
erasing his memory...

00:04:31.484 --> 00:04:34.324
or about you having to pay
the price for a choice...

00:04:34.924 --> 00:04:38.084
you never made.
It's not fair, I know.

00:04:38.844 --> 00:04:40.884
And then, I made it worse
at the restaurant

00:04:40.964 --> 00:04:42.204
by trying to...

00:04:42.444 --> 00:04:43.884
Anyway. Anyway...

00:04:44.444 --> 00:04:46.084
I'm sorry.

00:04:46.244 --> 00:04:47.764
I'm used to knowing

00:04:47.844 --> 00:04:49.484
what the right thing
to do is...

00:04:49.684 --> 00:04:52.764
but now, I'm not sure anymore.

00:04:52.924 --> 00:04:54.844
I just wanna be...

00:04:56.004 --> 00:04:57.084
(SIGHS)

00:04:57.164 --> 00:04:58.484
a good dad.

00:05:02.484 --> 00:05:04.484
VIOLET: You're not good.

00:05:06.604 --> 00:05:08.124
You're super.

00:05:09.564 --> 00:05:10.804
(BOB SNORING)

00:05:17.964 --> 00:05:20.724
Are superheroes allowed
to drink on duty?

00:05:20.924 --> 00:05:23.964
I'm definitely not on duty.
Ignore the costume.

00:05:24.124 --> 00:05:26.164
I know I should be up there...

00:05:26.324 --> 00:05:28.444
but I had to step away from
the grip and grins, you know?

00:05:28.604 --> 00:05:31.564
Gotta get away
to keep it pure. I know I do.

00:05:31.724 --> 00:05:33.324
What are you getting
away from?

00:05:33.484 --> 00:05:36.644
Eh, you know, company stuff.
My brother, mostly.

00:05:36.804 --> 00:05:38.724
But you love him,
you two are this company.

00:05:38.804 --> 00:05:39.844
Yin and yang.

00:05:40.004 --> 00:05:42.444
Yeah, I invent the stuff,
he's good at people.

00:05:42.604 --> 00:05:46.724
Pleasing them, engaging them,
figuring out what they want.

00:05:46.884 --> 00:05:48.564
I never know what people want.

00:05:49.044 --> 00:05:50.564
What do you think they want?

00:05:51.004 --> 00:05:52.204
Ease.

00:05:52.284 --> 00:05:55.164
People will trade quality
for ease every time.

00:05:55.324 --> 00:05:58.484
It may be crap,
but hey, it's convenient.

00:05:58.644 --> 00:06:00.364
Yeah. Kind of like this case.

00:06:00.524 --> 00:06:01.524
What?
The Screenslaver?

00:06:01.684 --> 00:06:03.484
Yeah, something's not
sitting right.

00:06:03.564 --> 00:06:04.924
It was too easy.

00:06:05.084 --> 00:06:07.484
That was too easy?
(CHUCKLES) Wow.

00:06:08.404 --> 00:06:10.324
-Funny.
-What?

00:06:10.484 --> 00:06:11.924
Look at that.

00:06:12.084 --> 00:06:15.884
One of Screenslaver's monitors
is tuned into my suit cam.

00:06:16.044 --> 00:06:17.084
What?

00:06:18.204 --> 00:06:20.084
Isn't the suit cam
closed circuit?

00:06:20.164 --> 00:06:21.164
It is.

00:06:21.324 --> 00:06:23.684
Then how come
Screenslaver has it?

00:06:23.844 --> 00:06:25.444
Maybe he hacked it?

00:06:25.604 --> 00:06:27.964
So, he's sophisticated enough
to do that...

00:06:28.124 --> 00:06:30.604
but he has simple locks
on his doors?

00:06:30.764 --> 00:06:32.644
Maybe he wanted you
to find him.

00:06:32.804 --> 00:06:34.164
He wanted to get caught?

00:06:34.324 --> 00:06:36.324
He wanted you to win.

00:06:36.484 --> 00:06:38.564
That makes no sense.
He's a brilliant guy.

00:06:38.724 --> 00:06:40.044
If he's smart enough
to conceive

00:06:40.124 --> 00:06:41.284
of technology like this...

00:06:41.444 --> 00:06:43.964
he's smart enough to think
of something to do with it.

00:06:44.124 --> 00:06:46.004
The guy we put in jail
delivered pizzas.

00:06:46.084 --> 00:06:47.084
So?

00:06:47.244 --> 00:06:48.844
Einstein was a patent clerk.

00:06:49.004 --> 00:06:51.044
Look, you won.
You got the guy who...

00:06:51.204 --> 00:06:53.444
Wait. All Screenslaver
needs to do

00:06:53.524 --> 00:06:54.604
to hypnotize someone...

00:06:54.764 --> 00:06:56.844
is get a screen
in front of their eyes.

00:06:57.004 --> 00:07:01.004
But what if the screen doesn't
look like a screen?

00:07:03.564 --> 00:07:07.684
What if the pizza guy
is really a pizza guy...

00:07:07.844 --> 00:07:09.244
but he was controlled
by the screens

00:07:09.324 --> 00:07:10.324
built into his glasses...

00:07:11.724 --> 00:07:13.564
You are good.

00:07:17.884 --> 00:07:18.884
JONNY QUEST: (ON TV)
Look, the robot!

00:07:19.004 --> 00:07:19.964
It's taking off.

00:07:20.164 --> 00:07:21.244
DR. QUEST: I'm not getting
a reading yet.

00:07:21.404 --> 00:07:22.924
RACE: Press "fire"?
DR. QUEST: Now!

00:07:23.044 --> 00:07:24.844
(MUSIC PLAYING ON TV)

00:07:26.084 --> 00:07:27.164
More power.

00:07:27.324 --> 00:07:28.764
JONNY QUEST: Oh, I hope
this works, Dad.

00:07:30.124 --> 00:07:32.844
I thought it was best
to just let you sleep.

00:07:33.004 --> 00:07:35.084
Seventeen hours.

00:07:35.884 --> 00:07:37.724
-How do you feel?
-(CHUCKLES)

00:07:38.204 --> 00:07:39.324
Super.

00:07:39.484 --> 00:07:41.564
-You got it, Dad.
-Hurray!

00:07:42.564 --> 00:07:44.564
BOB: I can't tell you
how much I appreciate

00:07:44.644 --> 00:07:46.564
you watching
Jack-Jack for me, E.

00:07:46.724 --> 00:07:49.684
Yes, I'm sure your gratitude
is quite inexpressible.

00:07:49.844 --> 00:07:51.524
Don't ask me
to do it again, darling.

00:07:51.604 --> 00:07:52.844
My rates are far too high.

00:07:52.964 --> 00:07:54.204
Oh, uh...

00:07:54.284 --> 00:07:56.524
I am joking, Robert.
I enjoyed the assignment.

00:07:56.684 --> 00:07:58.404
He is bright
and I am stimulating.

00:07:58.564 --> 00:07:59.964
We deserve each other.

00:08:00.644 --> 00:08:02.804
Your child is a polymorph.

00:08:02.924 --> 00:08:05.284
Like all babies,
he has enormous potential.

00:08:05.444 --> 00:08:07.044
It is not unknown for supers

00:08:07.124 --> 00:08:08.684
to have more than one power
when young...

00:08:08.884 --> 00:08:11.524
-but this little one has many.
-(BABBLING)

00:08:11.604 --> 00:08:14.604
Yes, you have many powers.

